│ Arginine Butyrate with standard local therapy in refractory sickle cell leg ulcers", "abstract": "Sickle cell leg    │
│ ulcers are often debilitating, refractory to healing, and prone to recurrence. Healing of leg ulcers was             │
│ incidentally observed during dose‐ranging trials of Arginine Butyrate in beta haemoglobinopathies. Here, a           │
